# Billing (monetization Phase 0+). Only the payment lifecycle lives in PayPal;
# entitlements and usage are read from Postgres (INV-2). PayPal ships no
# maintained Python SDK for Subscriptions, so app/billing/paypal_client.py
# talks to the REST API over httpx (already a dependency above) — no extra
# package.
# Test/lint tooling (pytest, pytest-asyncio, import-linter) lives in
# requirements-dev.txt so it stays out of the deployed image.
